#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:1 docs/features/companion.md:11
#: messages/po4a/en.xml:560
#, no-wrap
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"

#. type: Title #
#: docs/features/companion.md:1 docs/features/companion.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Desktop Companion"
msgstr "桌面伴侣"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "> **Dynamic SAP satellite**: a standalone desktop GUI app, not managed via `config.yaml`.\n"
msgstr "> **动态 SAP 卫星**：独立的桌面 GUI 应用，不通过 `config.yaml` 管理。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:10
msgid ""
"The desktop companion is a SAP **Type B** app (embedded sidecar holds the "
"Hub WebSocket, `relay: false`): the **content pack** (React + VRM + Node "
"sidecar) is embedded by **app/desktop**, registers with the Hub via SAP, and "
"exposes local tools to the Agent."
msgstr ""
"桌面伴侣是 SAP **Type B** 应用（嵌入式 sidecar 持有 Hub WebSocket，`relay: "
"false`）：**内容包**（React + VRM + Node sidecar）由 **app/desktop** 嵌入，通"
"过 SAP 向 Hub 注册，并向 Agent 暴露本地工具。"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/features/companion.md:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"FreeAnima Desktop (app/desktop)\n"
"├── Electron Main — tray / multi-window + embedded companion sidecar\n"
"│   ├── companion overlay — transparent always-on-top, VRM / speech bubble\n"
"│   ├── companion settings — settings window\n"
"│   ├── chat — Chat SPA (SAP direct, no sidecar)\n"
"│   └── admin — Admin WebView (Hub REST)\n"
"└── Renderer — preload satelliteShell; companion API via localhost sidecar\n"
"         ↕ SAP WS\n"
"    anima service Hub\n"
msgstr ""
"FreeAnima Desktop (app/desktop)\n"
"├── Electron Main — tray / multi-window + embedded companion sidecar\n"
"│   ├── companion overlay — transparent always-on-top, VRM / speech bubble\n"
"│   ├── companion settings — settings window\n"
"│   ├── chat — Chat SPA (SAP direct, no sidecar)\n"
"│   └── admin — Admin WebView (Hub REST)\n"
"└── Renderer — preload satelliteShell; companion API via localhost sidecar\n"
"         ↕ SAP WS\n"
"    anima service Hub\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:26
msgid ""
"The content pack lives in [`satellites/companion/`](../../satellites/"
"companion/) (`app/` + `server/` + `shared/`). Export conventions: [`frontend-"
"exports.md`](../sap/frontend-exports.md)."
msgstr ""
"内容包位于 [`satellites/companion/`](../../satellites/companion/)（`app/` + "
"`server/` + `shared/`）。导出约定：[`frontend-exports.md`](../sap/frontend-"
"exports.md)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:28
msgid "Compared with Chat / pair programming:"
msgstr "与聊天室 / 结对编程对比："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|             | Chat / pair programming              | Companion                                            |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| UI          | Browser Web UI                       | Native transparent companion window + settings       |\n"
"| Deployment  | Managed (can co-locate with service) | Dynamic (user starts manually)                       |\n"
"| SAP         | Type A or Type B + relay             | Type B + tools, no relay                             |\n"
"| Client & UI | Can be separated                     | Companion render and settings share one Electron app |\n"
msgstr ""
"|             | 聊天室 / 结对编程        | 伴侣                                         |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| UI          | 浏览器 Web UI                 | 原生透明伴侣窗口 + 设置    |\n"
"| 部署  | 托管（可与 service 同机部署） | 动态（用户手动启动）                |\n"
"| SAP         | Type A 或 Type B + relay       | Type B + 工具，无 relay                          |\n"
"| 客户端与 UI | 可分离               | 伴侣渲染与设置共用同一 Electron 应用 |\n"

#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/features/companion.md:36 messages/po4a/en.xml:565
#, no-wrap
msgid "Features"
msgstr "功能"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid ""
"VRM avatar rendering (Three.js + `@pixiv/three-vrm`); VRM 1.0 and 0.x auto "
"orientation correction"
msgstr ""
"VRM 形象渲染（Three.js + `@pixiv/three-vrm`）；VRM 1.0 与 0.x 自动朝向校正"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid ""
"**Motion slots**: five slots — `idle`, `rest`, `walk`, `climb`, `in_place`; "
"each slot binds 0..n VRMA clips; play by id or random; empty slot = no "
"animation"
msgstr ""
"**动作槽位**：五个槽位 — `idle`、`rest`、`walk`、`climb`、`in_place`；每槽绑"
"定 0..n 个 VRMA 片段；按 id 或随机播放；空槽 = 无动画"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid ""
"**Speech bubble**: one-way text queue; user click advances; no auto-dismiss; "
"pushed by Hub Agent via `companion.bubble` tool"
msgstr ""
"**语音气泡**：单向文本队列；用户点击推进；不自动消失；由 Hub Agent 通过 "
"`companion.bubble` 工具推送"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid ""
"Transparent always-on-top companion window (160×260); avatar area clickable, "
"empty area click-through"
msgstr "透明置顶伴侣窗口（160×260）；形象区域可点击，空白区域点击穿透"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid ""
"**Local interaction**: drag to move window; click body to play random motion "
"from `in_place` slot"
msgstr "**本地交互**：拖拽移动窗口；点击身体从 `in_place` 槽随机播放动作"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid ""
"**Patrol** (Settings → Behavior tab): idle patrol, double-click patrol, "
"corner pause, patrol speed, return-to-start on launch, etc."
msgstr ""
"**巡逻**（设置 → 行为标签页）：空闲巡逻、双击巡逻、角落暂停、巡逻速度、启动时"
"回到起点等"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid ""
"System tray: show/hide companion, **Settings…** (open settings window), quit"
msgstr "系统托盘：显示/隐藏伴侣、**设置…**（打开设置窗口）、退出"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:46
msgid ""
"Settings tabs: **General** / **Behavior** / **Models** / **Motion slots** / "
"**Motion library**"
msgstr "设置标签页：**常规** / **行为** / **模型** / **动作槽位** / **动作库**"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/companion.md:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Agent tools (sidecar registration)"
msgstr "Agent 工具（sidecar 注册）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:53
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Tool        | Parameters                           | Description                            |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `bubble`    | `text: string`                       | Enqueue text in speech bubble          |\n"
"| `play_slot` | `slot: string`; `motion_id?: string` | Play motion slot; `motion_id` optional |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 工具        | 参数                           | 说明                          |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `bubble`    | `text: string`                       | 在语音气泡中排队文本        |\n"
"| `play_slot` | `slot: string`；`motion_id?: string` | 播放动作槽位；`motion_id` 可选 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:55
msgid ""
"Periodic content (e.g. scheduled jokes) is configured on **anima service / "
"scheduled tasks**; the Agent calls `bubble`. Companion has no built-in timer."
msgstr ""
"周期性内容（如定时笑话）在 **anima service / 定时任务** 中配置；Agent 调用 "
"`bubble`。伴侣无内置定时器。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/companion.md:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Models and motions"
msgstr "模型与动作"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:59
msgid ""
"The repo **does not bundle** `.vrm` / `.vrma` files. Config persists in "
"`~/.anima/companion/config.json` (`models`, `motion_library`, "
"`motion_slots`, `behavior`)."
msgstr ""
"仓库**不捆绑** `.vrm` / `.vrma` 文件。配置持久化于 `~/.anima/companion/"
"config.json`（`models`、`motion_library`、`motion_slots`、`behavior`）。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/companion.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "VRM models"
msgstr "VRM 模型"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:63
msgid ""
"Settings → **Models** tab: list, import, delete, rename, switch current "
"model. Files saved to `~/.anima/companion/models/`."
msgstr ""
"设置 → **模型**标签页：列表、导入、删除、重命名、切换当前模型。文件保存至 "
"`~/.anima/companion/models/`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:65
msgid ""
"During development, files in `satellites/companion/public/models/` serve as "
"fallback."
msgstr "开发期间，`satellites/companion/public/models/` 中的文件作为回退。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/companion.md:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "VRMA library and slots"
msgstr "VRMA 库与槽位"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:69
msgid ""
"Settings → **Motion library** tab: import VRMA ZIP or single files; **Motion "
"slots** tab: assign motions per slot. Preview supports mouse drag to rotate "
"view."
msgstr ""
"设置 → **动作库**标签页：导入 VRMA ZIP 或单文件；**动作槽位**标签页：为各槽分"
"配动作。预览支持鼠标拖拽旋转视角。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:71
msgid ""
"Motion files: `~/.anima/companion/motions/`. Unbound slots play no "
"animation; patrol still moves the window; walk/climb VRMA play only when "
"bound."
msgstr ""
"动作文件：`~/.anima/companion/motions/`。未绑定槽位不播放动画；巡逻仍会移动窗"
"口；walk/climb VRMA 仅在绑定后播放。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/companion.md:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "Development and run"
msgstr "开发与运行"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/companion.md:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Browser dev (no Electron)"
msgstr "浏览器开发（无 Electron）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:77
msgid "In `satellites/companion`:"
msgstr "在 `satellites/companion` 中："

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/features/companion.md:78
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"bun run dev\n"
"# or bun satellites/companion/dev.ts\n"
msgstr ""
"bun run dev\n"
"# or bun satellites/companion/dev.ts\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:85
msgid "Companion: http://127.0.0.1:4176"
msgstr "伴侣：http://127.0.0.1:4176"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/companion.md:85
msgid "Settings (browser dev): http://127.0.0.1:4176/?view=settings"
msgstr "设置（浏览器开发）：http://127.0.0.1:4176/?view=settings"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:87
msgid ""
"In the Electron desktop shell, open settings via tray → **Settings…**; the "
"overlay has no settings button."
msgstr ""
"在 Electron 桌面壳层中，通过托盘 → **设置…** 打开设置；悬浮层无设置按钮。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/features/companion.md:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "Electron desktop shell (companion + Chat + Admin)"
msgstr "Electron 桌面壳层（伴侣 + 聊天室 + 管理台）"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/features/companion.md:90
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cd app/desktop\n"
"bun install\n"
"bun dev:electron\n"
msgstr ""
"cd app/desktop\n"
"bun install\n"
"bun dev:electron\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:97
msgid "Packaging (Linux cross-build for Windows):"
msgstr "打包（Linux 交叉构建 Windows）："

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/features/companion.md:98
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Daily: portable win-unpacked (~20s; copy exe to Windows)\n"
"bun run dev:windows\n"
"\n"
"# Installer / install-flow test (NSIS, ~2min+)\n"
"bun run package:windows\n"
msgstr ""
"# Daily: portable win-unpacked (~20s; copy exe to Windows)\n"
"bun run dev:windows\n"
"\n"
"# Installer / install-flow test (NSIS, ~2min+)\n"
"bun run package:windows\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:107
msgid ""
"Or from `app/desktop`: `bun run dev:windows` / `bun run package:windows`. "
"Fast path keeps `vendor/` and `release/` for incremental builds; full clean: "
"`DESKTOP_SHELL_CLEAN=1`."
msgstr ""
"或在 `app/desktop` 中：`bun run dev:windows` / `bun run package:windows`。快"
"速路径保留 `vendor/` 与 `release/` 以增量构建；完全清理："
"`DESKTOP_SHELL_CLEAN=1`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:109
msgid "Environment variables:"
msgstr "环境变量："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:115
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Variable                 | Default                 | Description                                     |\n"
"| ------------------------ | ----------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `FREEANIMA_URL`          | `http://127.0.0.1:2658` | Hub fallback when no desktop `settings.json`    |\n"
"| `SATELLITE_PORT`         | `4176`                  | Local HTTP port                                 |\n"
"| `COMPANION_VRMA_ZIP_URL` | (empty)                 | Optional direct zip mirror; downloaded on start |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 变量                 | 默认值                 | 说明                                      |\n"
"| ------------------------ | ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `FREEANIMA_URL`          | `http://127.0.0.1:2658` | 无桌面 `settings.json` 时的 Hub 回退     |\n"
"| `SATELLITE_PORT`         | `4176`                  | 本地 HTTP 端口                                  |\n"
"| `COMPANION_VRMA_ZIP_URL` | （空）                 | 可选的直接 zip 镜像；启动时下载  |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:117
msgid ""
"Hub URL and remote token are managed by the desktop shell in **`~/.anima-"
"desktop/settings.json`** (`hub` section; tray → **Hub settings…**). "
"Companion Settings → General tab shows Hub URL read-only."
msgstr ""
"Hub URL 与远程 token 由桌面壳层在 **`~/.anima-desktop/settings.json`**"
"（`hub` 段；托盘 → **Hub 设置…**）管理。伴侣设置 → 常规标签页以只读方式显示 "
"Hub URL。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:119
msgid ""
"Hub assigns a **3-character** `instance_id` on first `connect`, stored in "
"`~/.anima/companion/instance.json` (not under `satellites/`)."
msgstr ""
"Hub 在首次 `connect` 时分配 **3 字符** `instance_id`，存于 `~/.anima/"
"companion/instance.json`（不在 `satellites/` 下）。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/companion.md:120 docs/features/mobile-app.md:51
#: docs/guide/database.md:91 docs/guide/remote-access.md:128
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion.md:129
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Symptom                  | Action                                                                               |\n"
"| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| Double-click, no window  | Check system tray; tray → **Settings…** → import `.vrm`                              |\n"
"| Click, no motion         | Settings → **Motion library** import VRMA; **Motion slots** bind slot                |\n"
"| Cannot reach Hub         | Confirm `anima service` and `remote_auth.token`; tray **Hub settings** URL and token |\n"
"| Import has no effect     | Hot reload after import; confirm slot has motion checked                             |\n"
"| Background service fails | See `~/.anima/app/desktop/shell.log`; confirm ports 4176–4185 free                   |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 现象              | 处理                                                                                  |\n"
"| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 双击无窗口 | 检查系统托盘；托盘 → **设置…** → 导入 `.vrm`                              |\n"
"| 点击无动作     | 设置 → **动作库** 导入 VRMA；**动作槽位** 绑定槽位                 |\n"
"| 无法连接 Hub     | 确认 `anima service` 与 `remote_auth.token`；托盘 **Hub 设置** 中的 URL 与 token  |\n"
"| 导入无效果 | 导入后热重载；确认槽位已勾选动作                              |\n"
"| 后台服务失败 | 见 `~/.anima/app/desktop/shell.log`；确认端口 4176–4185 空闲                |\n"

